(
    title: "Lock \'n\' Chase",
    developer: Some("Bruce Pedersen"),
    description: Some("A cops-and-robbers chase through the corridors of a bank vault: your thief runs the maze scooping up gold bars while four policemen close in, and a single touch ends his run. Clear every bar and the red door at the top of the screen opens for the escape, with a fresh vault-full waiting after it. Treasures surface in the middle of the maze for a few seconds at a time and are worth the detour, but you only get five thieves."),
